#
# Counter-example for math:DerivedDimensionShape: a math:DerivedDimension declaring no
# math:baseDimensionExponent cell (sh:minCount 1), so validation MUST emit
# shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (and no other finding).
# Bound by tests/example-conformance.ttl (ex:ecDerivedDimensionNoExponents).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:emptyDimension a math:DerivedDimension .
